/*
 * Implements semantic validation for map comprehensions iterating over a class.
 *
 * The object is traversed with the class iteration protocol(begin, end, next),
 * and the pair produced at each iteration is inserted in the constructed map.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::compose::mapfor::class_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/compose/mapfor/class_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
